# lane c5-particles: fx.cpp recorded (tools/probes/client/fx.cpp.probe.diff): the client's IEffects muzzle
# flashes (default, gunship, strider), smoke and ricochet, FX_MuzzleEffectAttached on the local player, and
# the Smoke, GunshipImpact and CommandPointer client effects, run locally by the probe commands.
